For those that can't get half 'n' half, this one is for you. I make super easy ice cream using 18% coffee cream (UK Single Cream) and its delicious 🤤 you won't believe how easy it is. 

I added some dulce de leche and some caramel chocolate and made an AMAZING coffee caramel sundae that you must try. Again, this recipe will work with any alcohol/ethanol based food extracts. They are literally  EVERYWHERE. Bulk barn, supermarkets, Whole foods, Amazon.....the list goes on. 

